# T_SCRE: the note of a copy outlives the item's tabs: item 1 copied
# with Ctrl-D, the copy's Parts tab opened and left, then the copy's
# form left, the list showing "Copied as item 46"; the same with the
# Service tab of the copy of item 2 and the Loans tab of the copy of
# item 3.
K CTRL-D
S COPY1
K ALT-C P
S PARTS
K ESC
S BACKP
K ESC
S LISTP
K DOWN CTRL-D
K ALT-C S
S SERVICE
K ESC ESC
S LISTS
K DOWN CTRL-D
K ALT-C A
S LOANS
K ESC ESC
S LISTL
K ESC
